Recommendation
--------------
Use **Apache License 2.0**. Rationale:
  * The external training dependency (Intellindust-AI-Lab/DEIMv2) is Apache-2.0, so an
    Apache-2.0 license on this reproduction code is compatible and consistent.
  * Apache-2.0 is a permissive, publication-friendly license widely accepted by journals
    and by Zenodo/GitHub archival.
  * MIT is an acceptable alternative if a shorter permissive license is preferred.

Before replacing this file, confirm with the Ontario Ministry of Natural Resources
(Lake Ontario Management Unit) that the chosen license is consistent with any Crown
copyright / government open-data licensing requirements that apply to this work.

Third-party components retain their own licenses:
  * DEIMv2 (Intellindust-AI-Lab/DEIMv2) — Apache License 2.0
  * DINOv3 backbone weights — see the upstream model card for terms
